<title>USA: NOTICE OF SALE - Spartanburg Sanitary, S.C.</title>
<headline>NOTICE OF SALE - Spartanburg Sanitary, S.C.</headline>
<text>
<p>CORRECTION TO NOTICE OF SALE</p>
<p>				  $7,195,000</p>
<p>SPARTANBURG SANITARY SEWER DISTRICT, SOUTH CAROLINA</p>
<p>		 GENERAL OBLIGATION BOND, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>The principal amount  of the Bond  in the above  Notice Of Sale, published on February 14, 1997, should be corrected to read &quot;$7,195,000.&quot;  The purchase  price will  be  $7,195,000  plus accrued  interest from  February 1,  1997.   All  other</p>
<p>amounts  in  the  Notice  Of  Sale,  including  the  maximum quarterly repayment amount of $176,398.92 are unchanged.</p>
<p>			  (From The Bond Buyer)</p>
</text>
